# Smart Medicine Safety & Drug Interaction Assistant

## Executive Summary

Smart Medicine Safety & Drug Interaction Assistant is an AI-powered healthcare platform designed to improve medication safety by helping users identify medicines, detect potential drug interactions, analyze prescriptions, and generate patient-friendly safety reports.

The solution combines clinical terminology validation, prescription OCR, interaction screening, AI-assisted explanations, and report generation into a unified workflow.

---

## Key Innovations

### Intelligent Medicine Recognition
- Medicine name validation using RxNorm
- Automatic spelling correction
- Standardized clinical terminology mapping

### Drug Interaction Analysis
- Multi-drug interaction screening
- Risk identification
- Patient-friendly explanations

### Prescription OCR
- Extract medicine names from uploaded prescription images
- Automated medicine recognition workflow

### AI-Assisted Guidance
- Simplified medication explanations
- Safety awareness recommendations
- Human-readable clinical summaries

### Automated Reporting
- Downloadable PDF reports
- Medication history tracking
- Safety assessment documentation

---

## System Workflow

Patient Input
